{"seq":1,"slug":"capacity-modeling","title":"容量建模方法：排队论、Little's Law 与 USL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/capacity-modeling","wordCount":1700,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"容量建模方法-排队论-little-s-law-与-usl\">容量建模方法：排队论、Little&#39;s Law 与 USL</h1><p>容量建模是把&quot;系统能处理多少请求&quot;从经验直觉变成可计算数字的工程实践。掌握三个核心工具——排队论 M/M/c 模型、Little&#39;s Law、Universal Scalability Law——可以在不上线测试的情况下预测系统瓶颈，为伸缩决策提供定量依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M/M/c 模型</td>\n<td>排队论模型，M 代表泊松到达/指数服务时间，c 代表服务器数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用率 ρ</td>\n<td>λ/(c·μ)，系统繁忙程度；ρ ≥ 1 时队列无限增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Little&#39;s Law</td>\n<td>L = λ × W，系统中并发量 = 吞吐量 × 响应时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USL</td>\n<td>通用可扩展性定律，描述系统吞吐量随并发数增加的真实曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞争系数 σ</td>\n<td>USL 中串行化（锁争用）对扩展性的影响系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性系数 κ</td>\n<td>USL 中分布式协调开销对扩展性的影响系数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"排队论基础-m-m-c-模型\">排队论基础：M/M/c 模型</h2><p><strong>排队论</strong>（Queueing Theory）把系统抽象为一个服务队列：请求到达、等待处理、被处理、离开。最常用的模型是 <strong>M/M/c</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>M（Markovian）</strong>：到达过程是泊松分布（到达间隔呈指数分布）</li>\n<li><strong>M（Markovian）</strong>：服务时间是指数分布</li>\n<li><strong>c</strong>：服务器（处理器/线程/Pod）数量</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[请求到达\\n泊松过程 λ] --&gt; Q[等待队列]&#10;    Q --&gt; S1[服务器 1\\n服务率 μ]&#10;    Q --&gt; S2[服务器 2\\n服务率 μ]&#10;    Q --&gt; Sc[服务器 c\\n服务率 μ]&#10;    S1 --&gt; D[请求离开]&#10;    S2 --&gt; D&#10;    Sc --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[请求到达\\n泊松过程 λ] --&gt; Q[等待队列]\n    Q --&gt; S1[服务器 1\\n服务率 μ]\n    Q --&gt; S2[服务器 2\\n服务率 μ]\n    Q --&gt; Sc[服务器 c\\n服务率 μ]\n    S1 --&gt; D[请求离开]\n    S2 --&gt; D\n    Sc --&gt; D</pre><h3 id=\"核心参数与公式\">核心参数与公式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>λ（lambda）</td>\n<td>请求到达率</td>\n<td>请求/秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>μ（mu）</td>\n<td>单个服务器的服务率</td>\n<td>请求/秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>c</td>\n<td>服务器数量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ρ = λ/(c·μ)</td>\n<td>系统利用率</td>\n<td>0~1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>稳定条件</strong>：ρ &lt; 1，即 λ &lt; c·μ。当 ρ ≥ 1 时队列无限增长，系统过载。</p>\n<p><strong>Erlang C 公式</strong>（等待概率 P_wait）是 M/M/c 的核心：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0 = \\left[\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1} \\frac{(c\\rho)^k}{k!} + \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}\\right]^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3072em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0051em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.254em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{wait} = \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)} \\cdot P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>平均等待时间</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q = \\frac{P_{wait}}{\\mu \\cdot c(1-\\rho)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"实际应用示例\">实际应用示例</h3><p>假设一个 API 服务：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>到达率 λ = 800 req/s</li>\n<li>单个 Pod 服务率 μ = 200 req/s（平均响应 5ms）</li>\n<li>目标：P99 等待时间 ≤ 10ms</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要多少 Pod？</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"最低需要 c = ceil(λ/μ) = ceil(800/200) = 4 个 Pod&#10;利用率 ρ = 800/(4×200) = 1.0 → 系统临界！&#10;&#10;增加到 5 个 Pod：ρ = 800/(5×200) = 0.8&#10;平均等待时间 Wq ≈ 1.25ms，P99 约 6ms ✓\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>最低需要 c = ceil(λ/μ) = ceil(800/200) = 4 个 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>利用率 ρ = 800/(4×200) = 1.0 → 系统临界！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>增加到 5 个 Pod：ρ = 800/(5×200) = 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>平均等待时间 Wq ≈ 1.25ms，P99 约 6ms ✓</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键洞察</strong>：利用率 ρ 从 0.8 升到 0.9，延迟不是线性增长而是指数级飙升。这就是为什么容量规划要保留 <strong>headroom</strong>，通常维持 ρ ≤ 0.7。</p>\n<h2 id=\"little-s-law-系统三要素的铁律\">Little&#39;s Law：系统三要素的铁律</h2><p><strong>Little&#39;s Law</strong> 是排队论中最简洁也最实用的定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>L</strong>：系统中平均请求数（并发量）</li>\n<li><strong>λ</strong>：平均到达率（吞吐量，req/s）</li>\n<li><strong>W</strong>：请求在系统中的平均时间（响应时间，秒）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个公式的强大之处在于它<strong>不依赖任何分布假设</strong>，只要系统处于稳态就成立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-little-s-law-推导容量需求\">用 Little&#39;s Law 推导容量需求</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[已知:目标吞吐量 λ\\n已知:目标响应时间 W] --&gt; B[计算所需并发量\\nL = λ × W]&#10;    B --&gt; C[换算为资源需求\\n线程数 / 连接数 / Pod 数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[验证:实际 W&#39; = L/λ\\n是否满足 SLA？]\">flowchart TD\n    A[已知:目标吞吐量 λ\\n已知:目标响应时间 W] --&gt; B[计算所需并发量\\nL = λ × W]\n    B --&gt; C[换算为资源需求\\n线程数 / 连接数 / Pod 数]\n    C --&gt; D[验证:实际 W' = L/λ\\n是否满足 SLA？]</pre><p><strong>场景：数据库连接池大小规划</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>目标：支持 1000 req/s 的 API 流量</li>\n<li>每个请求的数据库查询时间 W = 20ms = 0.02s</li>\n<li>所需并发连接数 L = 1000 × 0.02 = <strong>20 个并发连接</strong></li>\n<li>连接池大小建议设为 25~30（预留 25% buffer）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>另一个方向：从并发数推算最大吞吐</strong></p>\n<p>若数据库连接池限制为 100 个连接，查询平均耗时 30ms：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最大支持吞吐量 λ = L/W = 100/0.03 ≈ <strong>3333 req/s</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"little-s-law-的陷阱\">Little&#39;s Law 的陷阱</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>稳态假设</strong>：系统必须处于稳态（到达率 ≈ 离开率）。突发流量下该公式失效。</li>\n<li><strong>平均值局限</strong>：L、λ、W 都是平均值，P99/P999 的尾延迟需要额外建模。</li>\n<li><strong>系统边界</strong>：L 和 W 必须定义在<strong>同一个系统边界</strong>内。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"usl-通用可扩展性定律\">USL：通用可扩展性定律</h2><p><strong>Universal Scalability Law（USL）</strong> 由 Neil Gunther 提出，是容量建模中最重要的工具之一。它描述了系统吞吐量随并发数（或服务器数）增加时的真实行为。</p>\n<h3 id=\"线性扩展的幻觉\">线性扩展的幻觉</h3><p>理想情况下，并发数翻倍，吞吐量也翻倍。但实际系统中存在两种摩擦：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>竞争（Contention）</strong>：多个并发单元争用共享资源（锁、总线、数据库连接）</li>\n<li><strong>一致性（Coherency）</strong>：分布式系统中数据同步的代价（缓存失效、协调开销）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>USL 公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>κ</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X(N) = \\frac{\\lambda \\cdot N}{1 + \\sigma(N-1) + \\kappa N(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>X(N)</strong>：N 个并发单元时的系统吞吐量</li>\n<li><strong>λ</strong>：单并发时的基准吞吐量</li>\n<li><strong>σ（sigma）</strong>：竞争系数（0~1），反映串行化比例</li>\n<li><strong>κ（kappa）</strong>：一致性系数（0~1），反映协调开销</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"xychart\" data-source=\"xychart-beta&#10;    title &quot;USL:不同系数下的扩展曲线&quot;&#10;    x-axis [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64]&#10;    y-axis &quot;归一化吞吐量&quot; 0 --&gt; 8&#10;    line [1, 1.96, 3.69, 6.40, 9.60, 11.0, 9.5]&#10;    line [1, 1.90, 3.40, 5.30, 7.00, 7.5, 7.2]&#10;    line [1, 1.80, 2.90, 3.80, 4.20, 4.0, 3.5]\">xychart-beta\n    title \"USL:不同系数下的扩展曲线\"\n    x-axis [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64]\n    y-axis \"归一化吞吐量\" 0 --&gt; 8\n    line [1, 1.96, 3.69, 6.40, 9.60, 11.0, 9.5]\n    line [1, 1.90, 3.40, 5.30, 7.00, 7.5, 7.2]\n    line [1, 1.80, 2.90, 3.80, 4.20, 4.0, 3.5]</pre><h3 id=\"从-usl-拟合真实数据\">从 USL 拟合真实数据</h3><p><strong>步骤一：收集基准数据</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发数 N</th>\n<th>吞吐量 X(N) (req/s)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1850</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>5100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>6800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>7200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>6500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>步骤二：拟合 σ 和 κ</strong></p>\n<p>可用最小二乘法或工具（如 Python 的 <code>scipy.optimize.curve_fit</code>）拟合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.optimize import curve_fit&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def usl(N, sigma, kappa):&#10;    lam = 1.0  # 归一化&#10;    return (lam * N) / (1 + sigma * (N - 1) + kappa * N * (N - 1))&#10;&#10;N_data = np.array([1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64])&#10;X_data = X_data / X_data[0]  # 归一化到基准 1.0&#10;&#10;popt, _ = curve_fit(usl, N_data, X_data, bounds=(0, 1))&#10;sigma, kappa = popt&#10;print(f&quot;竞争系数 σ = {sigma:.4f}, 一致性系数 κ = {kappa:.6f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.optimize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curve_fit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> usl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(N, sigma, kappa):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 归一化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> N) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (N </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kappa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> N </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (N </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">N_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> X_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> X_data[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 归一化到基准 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">popt, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curve_fit(usl, N_data, X_data, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bounds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sigma, kappa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> popt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"竞争系数 σ = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sigma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, 一致性系数 κ = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kappa</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.6f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>步骤三：预测峰值容量</strong></p>\n<p>拟合后，求 X(N) 的极大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><mi>κ</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max} = \\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\sigma}{\\kappa}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7884em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6516em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6116em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7884em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若 σ=0.05，κ=0.001，则 N_max = sqrt(0.95/0.001) ≈ <strong>30.8</strong>，即服务器数超过 31 个后吞吐量开始下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"usl-在容量规划中的应用场景\">USL 在容量规划中的应用场景</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>预测水平扩展上限</strong>：在 16 Pod 时开始出现收益递减，应当考虑拆分服务或减少共享状态。</li>\n<li><strong>识别架构瓶颈</strong>：高 σ 值（&gt;0.1）说明存在显著的锁竞争或单点瓶颈；高 κ 值说明分布式协调开销过大。</li>\n<li><strong>评估重构价值</strong>：通过减少 σ 和 κ，量化架构改进对扩展上限的提升。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"容量建模工作流\">容量建模工作流</h2><p>将上述工具整合为一个可操作的工作流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[收集基准指标\\n吞吐量/延迟/资源利用率] --&gt; B[建立 M/M/c 模型\\n估算当前系统容量]&#10;    B --&gt; C[使用 Little&#39;s Law\\n验证并发数与延迟关系]&#10;    C --&gt; D[负载压测\\n收集不同并发数据]&#10;    D --&gt; E[USL 拟合\\n识别扩展极限]&#10;    E --&gt; F{是否接近\\n扩展上限?}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[架构优化\\n减少竞争/一致性开销]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H[设置容量目标\\nN_max 的 70%]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    H --&gt; I[配置自动伸缩\\n设置告警阈值]\">flowchart TD\n    A[收集基准指标\\n吞吐量/延迟/资源利用率] --&gt; B[建立 M/M/c 模型\\n估算当前系统容量]\n    B --&gt; C[使用 Little's Law\\n验证并发数与延迟关系]\n    C --&gt; D[负载压测\\n收集不同并发数据]\n    D --&gt; E[USL 拟合\\n识别扩展极限]\n    E --&gt; F{是否接近\\n扩展上限?}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[架构优化\\n减少竞争/一致性开销]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H[设置容量目标\\nN_max 的 70%]\n    G --&gt; B\n    H --&gt; I[配置自动伸缩\\n设置告警阈值]</pre><h2 id=\"常见建模误区\">常见建模误区</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只看 CPU 利用率</td>\n<td>CPU 80% 时内存或网络可能已成瓶颈</td>\n<td>同时监控 CPU、内存、网络 I/O、数据库连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假设线性扩展</td>\n<td>忽略竞争和一致性开销</td>\n<td>用 USL 建模，验证扩展曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按平均值规划</td>\n<td>峰值流量是平均值的 3~10 倍</td>\n<td>按 P99 和峰值建模，而非平均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略排队效应</td>\n<td>利用率 80% 看起来安全，但延迟可能激增</td>\n<td>用 M/M/c 计算特定利用率下的延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性建模</td>\n<td>流量模式随时间变化</td>\n<td>定期（季度或半年）重新拟合模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>容量建模的三个工具各有侧重：<strong>M/M/c 模型</strong>用于计算在特定并发数下的等待时间，帮助确定 headroom；<strong>Little&#39;s Law</strong> 提供吞吐量、并发数和响应时间三者之间的铁律约束，用于快速估算资源需求；<strong>USL</strong> 通过拟合历史数据揭示系统的真实扩展上限，识别架构瓶颈。三者结合使用，可以在不依赖猜测的情况下，对容量规划做出定量决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"demand-forecasting\">需求预测</a>——在有了容量建模工具后，如何预测未来的负载需求</li>\n<li>本章第三篇：<a href=\"cost-performance-tradeoffs\">成本性能权衡</a>——容量模型确定后，如何在成本约束下做最优资源选择</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容量建模方法：排队论、Little's Law 与 USL","id":"容量建模方法-排队论-little-s-law-与-usl"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排队论基础：M/M/c 模型","id":"排队论基础-m-m-c-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"核心参数与公式","id":"核心参数与公式"},{"level":3,"text":"实际应用示例","id":"实际应用示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Little's Law：系统三要素的铁律","id":"little-s-law-系统三要素的铁律"},{"level":3,"text":"用 Little's Law 推导容量需求","id":"用-little-s-law-推导容量需求"},{"level":3,"text":"Little's Law 的陷阱","id":"little-s-law-的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"USL：通用可扩展性定律","id":"usl-通用可扩展性定律"},{"level":3,"text":"线性扩展的幻觉","id":"线性扩展的幻觉"},{"level":3,"text":"从 USL 拟合真实数据","id":"从-usl-拟合真实数据"},{"level":3,"text":"USL 在容量规划中的应用场景","id":"usl-在容量规划中的应用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"容量建模工作流","id":"容量建模工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"常见建模误区","id":"常见建模误区"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"需求预测：时间序列、季节性与事件驱动峰值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/demand-forecasting"}}